    "kb:docs:wsl2_rocm_setup": {
      "type": "hash",
      "value": {
        "created_at": "2026-04-14T02:00:00",
        "content": "## WSL2 ROCm Docker Setup - CONFIRMED WORKING\\n\\n### Key Discovery\\nThe fix requires:\\n1. Pass /dev/dxg device (DirectX compute)\\n2. Mount /opt/rocm-7.2.1 from WSL2 to /opt/rocm in container\\n3. Mount /usr/lib/wsl/lib for WSL libraries\\n4. Set HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1\\n\\n### Do NOT use /dev/kfd or /dev/dri - they don't exist in WSL2\\n\\n### Working docker-compose section:\\nvolumes:\\n  - /opt/rocm-7.2.1:/opt/rocm:ro\\ndevices:\\n  - /dev/dxg:/dev/dxg\\nenvironment:\\n  - HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1\\n  - LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/rocm/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib\\n  - ROCM_PATH=/opt/rocm",
        "author": "system"
      }
    },
    "learnings:wsl_rocm_docker_complete": {
      "type": "hash",
      "value": {
        "part6_verification": "",
        "## PART 6: VERIFICATION COMMANDS": "",
        "### Test rocminfo (GPU Agent should appear):": "docker run --rm --device=/dev/dxg \\",
        "  -v /usr/lib/wsl/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib \\": "  -v /opt/rocm-7.2.1:/opt/rocm:ro \\",
        "  -e HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1 \\": "  -e LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/rocm/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib \\",
        "  rocm/dev-ubuntu-24.04:7.1.1-complete rocminfo": "",
        "Expected: Agent 2 - Name: gfx1201, Device Type: GPU": "",
        "### Test clinfo (OpenCL GPU support):": "docker run --rm --device=/dev/dxg \\",
        "  rocm/dev-ubuntu-24.04:7.1.1-complete clinfo": "",
        "Expected:": "- Number of platforms: 1",
        "- Number of devices: 1": "- Device Type: CL_DEVICE_TYPE_GPU",
        "- Board name: AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT": "- Device Topology: PCI[ B#3, D#0, F#0 ]",
        "- Max compute units: 32": "- Max memory allocation: ~14GB",
        "- Global memory size: ~16GB": "part3_wsl2_setup",
        "": "# 5. Install to /opt/rocm",
        "ls -la /dev/dxg": "# Should show: crw-rw-rw- 1 root root 10, 125 ... /dev/dxg",
        "# These are Linux kernel interfaces that WSL2 does not provide": "# DO NOT try to pass these through to containers - they won't work",
        "rocminfo": "# Should show Agent 2 with Name: gfx1201 (AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT)",
        "ldconfig -p | grep librocdxg": "# Should show: librocdxg.so in /opt/rocm/lib/",
        "part8_files_and_references": "",
        "## PART 8: FILE LOCATIONS AND REFERENCES": "",
        "### Key Files:": "- Source: https://github.com/ROCm/compute_tools (for librocdxg)",
        "- Documentation: E:\\\\AI-Setup\\\\assets\\\\LIBROCDXG_BUILD.md": "- Docker Config: E:\\\\AI-Setup\\\\dockerized-ai\\\\docker-compose-wsl2.yml",
        "- GPU Passthrough: E:\\\\AI-Setup\\\\docker-gpu-passthrough.md": "",
        "### ROCm Installation in WSL2:": "- Location: /opt/rocm-7.2.1",
        "- Contains: lib/librocdxg.so, lib/libhsa-runtime64.so, etc.": "",
        "### Docker Volumes:": "- /opt/rocm-7.2.1 from WSL2 -> /opt/rocm in container (READ ONLY)",
        "- /usr/lib/wsl/lib from WSL2 -> /usr/lib/wsl/lib in container (READ ONLY)": "",
        "### Environment Variables Summary:": "HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1   # Enable DirectX GPU detection",
        "LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/rocm/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib  # Search path": "ROCM_PATH=/opt/rocm           # ROCm root",
        "- GPU: AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT": "- Architecture: gfx1201 (RDNA4/Navi 4)",
        "- VRAM: 16GB": "- Compute Units: 32",
        "- OpenCL: 2.0": "- ROCm: Compatible via HSA DirectX path",
        "part5_docker_compose": "",
        "## PART 5: DOCKER-COMPOSE EXAMPLE": "",
        "version: '3.8'": "services:",
        "  rocm:": "    image: rocm/dev-ubuntu-24.04:7.1.1-complete",
        "    container_name: rocm-gpu-test": "    devices:",
        "      - /dev/dxg:/dev/dxg": "    volumes:",
        "      - /usr/lib/wsl/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib:ro": "      - /opt/rocm-7.2.1:/opt/rocm:ro",
        "    environment:": "      - HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1",
        "      - LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/rocm/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib": "      - ROCM_PATH=/opt/rocm",
        "    privileged: true": "    network_mode: host",
        "  ollama:": "    image: ollama/ollama:rocm",
        "    devices:": "      - /dev/dxg:/dev/dxg",
        "    volumes:": "      - /usr/lib/wsl/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib:ro",
        "      - ollama_data:/root/.ollama/models": "    environment:",
        "      - HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1": "      - LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/rocm/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib",
        "      - ROCM_PATH=/opt/rocm": "      - HSA_OVERRIDE_GFX_VERSION=12.0.1",
        "part7_troubleshooting": "",
        "## PART 7: TROUBLESHOOTING": "",
        "### Problem: rocminfo shows only CPU agent, no GPU": "Solution: ",
        "1. Verify /dev/dxg exists: ls -la /dev/dxg": "2. Verify ROCm installed: ls /opt/rocm-7.2.1/lib/librocdxg.so",
        "3. Ensure environment variables are set correctly": "4. Check docker run command includes all three mounts",
        "Solution: This is EXPECTED. rocm-smi needs amdgpu kernel module which ": "WSL2 does not provide. Use rocminfo or clinfo instead to verify GPU.",
        "Solution: Mount /opt/rocm-7.2.1:/opt/rocm:ro in container": "",
        "### Problem: GPU detected but PyTorch/torch throws error": "Solution: ROCm ROCm container libraries may have ABI incompatibility.",
        "The vLLM container (rocm/vllm) may need different library paths.": "For inference, using Ollama on Windows directly may work better.",
        "- /opt/rocm-7.2.1 - ROCm installation (contains librocdxg.so)": "- /usr/lib/wsl/lib - WSL2 libraries (must mount for docker)",
        "- /dev/dxg - DirectX compute device (only GPU device in WSL2)": "part4_docker_config",
        "docker run --rm --device=/dev/dxg \\": "  -v /usr/lib/wsl/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib \\",
        "  -v /opt/rocm-7.2.1:/opt/rocm:ro \\": "  -e HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1 \\",
        "  -e LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/rocm/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib \\": "  -e ROCM_PATH=/opt/rocm \\",
        "  rocm/dev-ubuntu-24.04:7.1.1-complete \\": "  rocminfo",
        "1. /dev/dxg:/dev/dxg - Pass DirectX compute device": "2. /usr/lib/wsl/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib - WSL2 libraries",
        "3. /opt/rocm-7.2.1:/opt/rocm:ro - ROCm libraries with librocdxg": "",
        "### The Three Critical Environment Variables:": "1. HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1 - Enable DirectX GPU detection",
        "2. LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/opt/rocm/lib:/usr/lib/wsl/lib - Library search path": "3. ROCM_PATH=/opt/rocm - ROCm installation path",
        "devices:": "  - /dev/kfd:/dev/kfd    # DOES NOT EXIST in WSL2",
        "  - /dev/dri:/dev/dri    # DOES NOT EXIST in WSL2": "",
        "### CORRECT - What Works:": "devices:",
        "  - /dev/dxg:/dev/dxg    # Only /dev/dxg exists and is needed": "author",
        "system": "created_at",
        "2026-04-14T02:05:00": "part2_building_librocdxg",
        "WSL2 does not expose the AMD GPU kernel module (amdgpu) to containers. ROCm needs ": "librocdxg to communicate via DirectX compute (/dev/dxg) instead.",
        "wget https://repo.radeon.com/rocm/apt/7.2.1/ rocm.gpg.key": "sudo apt update",
        "sudo apt install rocm-7.2.1": "",
        "# 2. Clone ROCm compute-tools repository": "git clone https://github.com/ROCm/compute_tools.git",
        "cd compute_tools": "",
        "# 3. Configure CMake for gfx1201 (RX 9070 XT)": "cmake -B build \\",
        "  -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\": "  -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/opt/rocm-7.2.1 \\",
        "  -DAMDGPU_TARGETS=gfx1201": "",
        "# 4. Build only librocdxg target": "cmake --build build --target librocdxg",
        "sudo cmake --install build --prefix /opt/rocm": "",
        "### Verify Installation:": "ls -la /opt/rocm/lib/librocdxg.so",
        "# Should show: -rwxr-xr-x ... /opt/rocm/lib/librocdxg.so": "",
        "### Important Notes:": "- librocdxg is NOT needed by ROCm runtime itself - it's for Docker container access",
        "- ROCm can use /dev/dxg directly when HSA_ENABLE_DXG_DETECTION=1 is set": "- The key is mounting /opt/rocm-7.2.1 (which contains librocdxg) into containers",
        "summary": "Complete guide to enabling AMD GPU access in WSL2 Docker containers using ROCm and librocdxg",
        "updated_at": "2026-04-14T02:05:00",
        "status": "TESTED_AND_CONFIRMED_WORKING",
        "version": "2.0",
        "tags": "WSL2,ROCm,Docker,GPU,AMD,9070XT,gfx1201,passthrough,librocdxg,DirectX,Complete-Guide",
        "part1_prerequisites": "",
        "## PART 1: PREREQUISITES": "",
        "### Software Required:": "- Windows 10/11 with WSL2 enabled",
        "- Docker Desktop with WSL2 backend": "- Windows SDK 10.0.26100.0 (for building librocdxg)",
        "- CMake 3.x": "- AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (gfx1201/RDNA4)",
        "- WSL2 Ubuntu-24.04": "- ROCm 7.2.1 installed in WSL2",
        "category": "GPU-Passthrough"
      }
